  },
  {
   "index": 28,
   "tag": "blockquote",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 456,
   "text": "That same year, Dylan told Sing Out! magazine:\nThere ain’t much I can say about this song, except the answer is blowin' in the wind. It ain’t no book or movie or TV show or discussion group, man. It’s in the wind … I still say it’s in the wind and just like a restless piece of paper it’s got to come down some … But the only trouble is that no one picks up the answer when it comes down so not too m",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
